1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 25]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,560
You again.

14
00:02:02,550 --> 00:02:03,250
The sand.

15
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,090
It's this sand.

16
00:02:13,990 --> 00:02:15,030
There was sand like this

17
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,020
in that golden jar too.

18
00:02:18,790 --> 00:02:19,860
Good catch.

19
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,540
This sand

20
00:02:23,230 --> 00:02:24,930
is everywhere around the Otherworld Tower.

21
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,770
It can disrupt

22
00:02:26,790 --> 00:02:27,700
your memory.

23
00:02:33,510 --> 00:02:34,520
Who exactly are you?

24
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,060
[I am you]

25
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,490
I am you?

26
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,710
Yes.

27
00:02:54,070 --> 00:02:54,890
I am

28
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,540
you.

29
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,210
You finally remembered.

30
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,380
Actually,

31
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,490
I am

32
00:03:15,230 --> 00:03:16,020
you.

33
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,050
You are

34
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,140
me?

35
00:03:22,070 --> 00:03:22,540
Yes.

36
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:24,770
When you first entered

37
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:25,820
the Otherworld Tower,

38
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:28,650
you discovered its secret.

39
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,420
You kept exploring

40
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,450
until you reached this place.

41
00:03:35,510 --> 00:03:36,300
But you knew

42
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,650
everything that happened

43
00:03:39,910 --> 00:03:41,300
would eventually be forgotten.

44
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,050
So all you could do

45
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:44,300
was leave important clues

46
00:03:45,510 --> 00:03:47,260
for your future self.

47
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:55,380
[I am you]

48
00:03:55,950 --> 00:03:57,140
To keep you from realizing the truth,

49
00:03:57,950 --> 00:03:59,210
everything was written

50
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,930
with the left hand.

51
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,490
So

52
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:08,100
you guided me all the way here

53
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,020
to tell me the truth

54
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,050
about the Otherworld Tower?

55
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:14,300
There's more.

56
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,890
I also want to tell you

57
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:18,330
how to move forward

58
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,700
from here.

59
00:04:25,470 --> 00:04:26,770
I've figured it out.

60
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:30,090
But you haven't.

61
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,330
Deep down,

62
00:04:32,990 --> 00:04:34,500
there's a vulnerable side of you

63
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,820
that you've always refused to face.

64
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:40,330
No.

65
00:04:42,470 --> 00:04:43,260
I'm no longer

66
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,500
the person I used to be.

67
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,770
Are you sure?

68
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,450
Think carefully.

69
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:53,650
There's one more thing

70
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,140
you haven't realized.

71
00:04:58,350 --> 00:04:59,260
As I just said,

72
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:00,820
I am

73
00:05:01,670 --> 00:05:02,380
you.

74
00:05:04,350 --> 00:05:04,940
But

75
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:07,850
you're not me yet.

76
00:05:10,470 --> 00:05:11,140
What?

77
00:05:26,990 --> 00:05:27,620
Laogou.

78
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:32,970
You must be exhausted

79
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,580
after everything we've been through.

80
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,380
Each floor of the Otherworld Tower is nested within another.

81
00:05:44,350 --> 00:05:45,290
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

82
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:47,260
has long since mastered the technique.

83
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,700
You and I are nothing more

84
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,260
than trapped beasts struggling inside a cage.

85
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,700
We'll all die here sooner or later.

86
00:05:55,470 --> 00:05:56,090
Deep down,

87
00:05:58,230 --> 00:05:59,500
we both knew this day would come.

88
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,650
Xiangu,

89
00:06:03,230 --> 00:06:04,210
come with me.

90
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,940
Let's leave the Otherworld Tower.

91
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:07,820
Leave the Japanese behind.

92
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,330
Leave everything here.

93
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,620
We'll find somewhere beautiful

94
00:06:12,910 --> 00:06:13,850
and live in seclusion together.

95
00:06:15,110 --> 00:06:16,820
Just like we promised before.

96
00:06:20,230 --> 00:06:20,970
Trust me.

97
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,180
I'll take care of everything

98
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,090
from here on out.

99
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:26,090
As long as I'm here,

100
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,580
you shouldn't have to bear

101
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,650
any of this.

102
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:36,850
Xiangu,

103
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:39,740
come with me.

104
00:07:08,230 --> 00:07:08,820
No.

105
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:10,620
No.

106
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:12,770
I can't leave.

107
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,620
No matter what happens,

108
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:17,500
I shouldn't run away.

109
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,330
I don't want to rely on anyone.

110
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:24,330
I want to rely on myself.

111
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,330
Just as you said,

112
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:45,740
you're no longer the person you used to be.

113
00:07:46,350 --> 00:07:47,210
Why did you use an illusion

114
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:48,140
to deceive me?

115
00:07:48,550 --> 00:07:49,580
I didn't deceive you.

116
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:53,290
Everything you saw in the illusion

117
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,290
came from deep within you.

118
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,620
But

119
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,530
what we're about to do

120
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:09,970
is very important.

121
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,420
You can't afford any weakness

122
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:12,740
in your heart.

123
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,770
Not even the slightest desire

124
00:08:14,770 --> 00:08:16,180
to rely on anyone else.

125
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:17,740
So

126
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:20,820
you tested me

127
00:08:22,910 --> 00:08:23,820
with Laogou?

128
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,890
The Star-Moon Sand here

129
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,170
is incredibly powerful.

130
00:08:36,430 --> 00:08:37,650
It pieces together your memories

131
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,260
and attacks

132
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,410
the deepest parts of your mind.

133
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:44,290
If there's even the slightest weakness,

134
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:46,570
you could be trapped

135
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:49,980
in this cycle forever.

136
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,380
So many Otherworld Towers were built here.

137
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,460
Could they be connected to that building?

138
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,650
I couldn't bring myself

139
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:17,890
to kill the members of Unit 401,

140
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,140
so I reluctantly agreed to help Hatoyama

141
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,260
find the Star-Moon Sand.

142
00:09:23,550 --> 00:09:23,980
But I never expected

143
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,980
there to be so many Zhainiangniang

144
00:09:25,710 --> 00:09:27,050
inside the infinite Otherworld Towers.

145
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,220
I spent a long time

146
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:35,650
taming those Zhainiangniang

147
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:36,690
the Japanese captured.

148
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:37,930
I led the Japanese

149
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,980
through this place.

150
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,140
But deeper inside,

151
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,810
the Otherworld Towers were still nested within one another.

152
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,530
There was no pattern at all.

153
00:09:50,710 --> 00:09:51,690
We couldn't find where the Star-Moon Sand

154
00:09:51,710 --> 00:09:53,140
Hatoyama wanted was.

155
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:17,410
Be careful.

156
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:19,890
Open it.

157
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,260
It's Star-Moon Sand, sir.

158
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:39,740
But there's too little,

159
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:41,220
and there are too many impurities.

160
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:49,860
Days went by like this.

161
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:51,860
Hatoyama grew increasingly dissatisfied.

162
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:54,860
The supplies the Japanese brought in

163
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,770
were running out.

164
00:10:58,070 --> 00:10:59,860
This Star-Moon Sand is very impure.

165
00:11:00,670 --> 00:11:01,380
When will you find

166
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,690
the high-purity Star-Moon Sand

167
00:11:03,190 --> 00:11:04,380
I want?

168
00:11:09,070 --> 00:11:10,100
I told you.

169
00:11:11,070 --> 00:11:12,340
I can only search a little at a time.

170
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,140
If you're not happy with this, find it yourselves.

171
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:38,260
Don't!

172
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,620
It's been so long, and you still haven't found

173
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,170
any high-purity Star-Moon Sand.

174
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,050
Our men

175
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:50,460
are getting weaker,

176
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:52,410
while those from Unit 401 are perfectly fine.

177
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:54,460
What are you up to?

178
00:11:54,590 --> 00:11:55,860
What does it have to do with me?

179
00:11:57,310 --> 00:11:58,290
We eat together.

180
00:11:58,300 --> 00:11:59,170
We sleep together.

181
00:11:59,830 --> 00:12:01,410
You even know when I take a dump.

182
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,690
This tower is trying to kill you all.

183
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:16,410
You're good at taming dogs, aren't you?

184
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,380
Let him find

185
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:20,340
the Star-Moon Sand instead.

186
00:12:24,070 --> 00:12:24,650
What?

187
00:12:25,430 --> 00:12:26,170
You won't?

188
00:12:27,830 --> 00:12:28,500
Fine.

189
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,170
If so,

190
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,620
I'll have the entire Unit 401

191
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:33,530
buried with you.

192
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,340
Wu Laogou,

193
00:12:42,430 --> 00:12:43,770
I'll count to three.

194
00:12:46,710 --> 00:12:47,380
Three.

195
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:52,340
Two.

196
00:12:59,160 --> 00:12:59,870
One.

197
00:12:59,870 --> 00:13:00,620
Fine!

198
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,260
I'll have him lead the way

199
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,980
and find you the Star-Moon Sand.

200
00:13:26,950 --> 00:13:27,810
Coward.

201
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,530
You coward.

202
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:42,050
I'm not Zhang Qishan.

203
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,810
There's nothing I can do.

204
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:48,890
Take this pill.

205
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:51,930
It'll make you obey.

206
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,290
Coward.

207
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,500
You coward!

208
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,500
Hang in there.

209
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,770
I'll get you out of here.

210
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:06,810
It's pointless.

211
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,860
I'm in so much pain.

212
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,130
Kill me.

213
00:14:09,130 --> 00:14:10,460
Just kill me.

214
00:15:05,070 --> 00:15:05,650
Sir,

215
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,020
he's putting him out of his misery.

216
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,810
He's cutting off our only lead to the Star-Moon Sand.

217
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,650
We can't trust him.

218
00:15:22,550 --> 00:15:24,220
We've all been poisoned already.

219
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:27,340
Am I right, Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

220
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,410
The Star-Moon Sand is poisonous.

221
00:15:30,710 --> 00:15:31,860
It's extremely dangerous.

222
00:15:33,070 --> 00:15:34,170
Star-Moon Sand dust

223
00:15:34,190 --> 00:15:35,340
is everywhere here.

224
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:37,220
The concentration is low,

225
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,460
but we're healthy

226
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,410
and breathe faster,

227
00:15:41,550 --> 00:15:42,650
so we've naturally been poisoned.

228
00:15:43,910 --> 00:15:44,810
But the 401 soldiers

229
00:15:44,830 --> 00:15:45,650
you drugged

230
00:15:46,310 --> 00:15:47,410
are weak

231
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:48,570
and have shallow breathing.

232
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,930
So even though they're poisoned,

233
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,980
they can hold out longer.

234
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:58,170
Now that he's dead,

235
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:00,570
you'll have to turn

236
00:16:00,590 --> 00:16:01,380
the Unit 401 soldiers

237
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:02,410
into Zhainiangniang again

238
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:03,530
and have them lead the way.

239
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,100
That means

240
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,260
you'll have to spend even more time

241
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:11,570
mutating them.

242
00:16:12,430 --> 00:16:13,770
If we stay here too long,

243
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:15,290
we could

244
00:16:15,310 --> 00:16:16,650
all die here

245
00:16:16,670 --> 00:16:18,020
from the Star-Moon Sand poisoning.

246
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:25,020
But maybe not.

247
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,050
We don't know

248
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:29,530
what the Star-Moon Sand

249
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,620
will do to people.

250
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:32,890
Am I right,

251
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:35,260
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

252
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,340
Go on.

253
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,140
What kind of deal

254
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:41,140
do you want to make with me?

255
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:43,410
I want you and your men

256
00:16:43,830 --> 00:16:45,460
to retreat outside Zhainiangniang Square.

257
00:16:45,710 --> 00:16:46,410
Stay in an area

258
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:47,740
free of Star-Moon Sand dust.

259
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:50,260
Let Unit 401 go in

260
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,410
and search for the Star-Moon Sand with me.

261
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:56,860
Zhainiangniang Square

262
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:57,890
is the only way out.

263
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,290
I can't escape.

264
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:01,260
But this way,

265
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,340
you can get what you want

266
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,530
without suffering any losses.

267
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:06,700
Sir.

268
00:17:15,770 --> 00:17:16,980
Hatoyama was extremely cautious.

269
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,980
He only gave me enough food for three days.

270
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:20,570
Every three days,

271
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:21,400
I had to bring out

272
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,290
whatever I found

273
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:24,660
and exchange it for another three days' worth of supplies.

274
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,290
Hatoyama retreated outside Zhainiangniang Square.

275
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:30,700
Everyone, stay close.

276
00:17:31,830 --> 00:17:32,940
Unit 401 and I continued deeper

277
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,810
to find a way out.

278
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:36,220
We searched for days.

279
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:37,940
The poison from the pills

280
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:38,740
inside their bodies

281
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:39,570
gradually wore off.

282
00:17:46,070 --> 00:17:46,980
But while

283
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:47,900
we were exploring,

284
00:17:48,590 --> 00:17:50,050
the Japanese drugged us with the Star-Moon Sand.

285
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,130
Our memories became scrambled.

286
00:18:01,390 --> 00:18:02,370
I want to get out of this ruddy place.

287
00:18:02,590 --> 00:18:03,660
- I want to get out of here!
- Fifth Master.

288
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,830
Fifth Master!

289
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,260
Calm down.

290
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,070
Zhang... Zhang Peiwu.

291
00:18:11,220 --> 00:18:11,850
Fifth Master,

292
00:18:13,830 --> 00:18:14,980
you didn't kill

293
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:16,740
any of our men.

294
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:18,900
It was the Japanese.

295
00:18:21,870 --> 00:18:22,500
The Japanese did.

296
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:27,770
Look.

297
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,050
Those Japanese

298
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:31,420
went back on their word.

299
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:32,900
They followed us all the way here.

300
00:18:33,830 --> 00:18:34,810
When we discovered them,

301
00:18:35,910 --> 00:18:36,660
they attacked.

302
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:37,800
Fifth Master,

303
00:18:39,870 --> 00:18:41,090
you saved me.

304
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:43,700
You killed the Japanese.

305
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:51,660
Fifth Master,

306
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,020
I found a scroll

307
00:18:53,390 --> 00:18:54,130
on him.

308
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,770
It's Yin Changsheng's experimental records.

309
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:57,030
I don't know if it'll be useful.

310
00:18:57,310 --> 00:18:57,850
Take a look.

311
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:07,570
What does this say?

312
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:09,130
"Those who take Lifeswapping Herb

313
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:11,740
will have their pulse nearly stop,

314
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,180
as if in a dream.

315
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,090
Only Star-Moon Sand can cure its poison."

316
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:22,370
Star-Moon Sand

317
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,290
can cure the poison of Lifeswapping Herb?

318
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:39,700
Don't feel guilty.

319
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,740
You did everything you could.

320
00:19:44,590 --> 00:19:45,330
What do you think

321
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:46,500
the Japanese need so much Star-Moon Sand for?

322
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,850
What exactly do they want it for?

323
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,260
They want to use the Star-Moon Sand

324
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:52,810
on the Chinese people.

325
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,420
What will happen

326
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,180
if they use it on the Chinese?

327
00:19:57,130 --> 00:19:58,320
Star-Moon Sand can numb

328
00:19:58,320 --> 00:19:59,290
the Chinese people's will

329
00:19:59,830 --> 00:20:01,330
and weaken the army's fighting ability.

330
00:20:02,150 --> 00:20:02,700
It can even

331
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,370
make us turn against one another,

332
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,020
allowing them to achieve victory

333
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,260
without having to fight.

334
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:09,850
Master Zhang is right.

335
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,370
That's why

336
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,420
I absolutely can't let Hatoyama succeed.

337
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,740
It took me a long time,

338
00:20:17,350 --> 00:20:18,700
but I finally found a cliff.

339
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,180
Climbing up led to a cave

340
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,980
that connected to an underground river.

341
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:23,660
It was also the place

342
00:20:24,390 --> 00:20:25,770
where I had once been imprisoned.

343
00:20:47,500 --> 00:20:51,500
[Xumi Realm]

344
00:21:12,550 --> 00:21:13,700
I discovered a pool

345
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:15,050
the Japanese had never explored.

346
00:21:15,870 --> 00:21:16,610
A soul-summoning banner

347
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:18,420
was floating on the water.

348
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,850
This water has to be constantly flowing.

349
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:21,540
[Memorial]

350
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,530
And it was connected to the underground river

351
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:24,090
the Japanese had taken me to.

352
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,460
But Unit 401 was too weak

353
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,740
to make it out.

354
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,090
So I had to hide them somewhere,

355
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:47,850
and go out alone

356
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:49,850
to get help.

357
00:21:51,070 --> 00:21:51,980
Then I'd come back for them

358
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:53,850
and wait for the right moment

359
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:56,290
to strike back at the Japanese.

360
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:22,940
Here.

361
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:25,330
These pills are made

362
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,090
from Lifeswapping Herb.

363
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,180
They can slow the heartbeat,

364
00:22:28,550 --> 00:22:29,530
like hibernation.

365
00:22:30,550 --> 00:22:31,610
Even without food or water,

366
00:22:31,870 --> 00:22:33,180
they can keep you going for half a month.

367
00:22:35,550 --> 00:22:36,130
Fifth Master.

368
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:37,850
Tell Master Zhang

369
00:22:38,550 --> 00:22:39,770
to kill all the Japanese.

370
00:22:40,870 --> 00:22:42,020
We can't let them succeed.

371
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,500
Don't worry about us.

372
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:47,330
Stopping Hatoyama

373
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:48,770
is what matters most.

374
00:22:54,760 --> 00:22:55,520
Fifth Master,

375
00:22:57,390 --> 00:22:58,130
please.

376
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:03,420
Don't worry.

377
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:06,020
I'll pass the message to Zhang Qishan.

378
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:08,610
Quick, take the medicine.

379
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:09,770
Come on.

380
00:23:11,910 --> 00:23:12,370
Here.

381
00:23:12,550 --> 00:23:13,290
Take one.

382
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:15,460
Here.

383
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,020
This is yours.

384
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:20,180
Come on.

385
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:25,050
Fifth Master.

386
00:23:35,590 --> 00:23:36,500
Salute!

387
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:56,660
So I wrote down

388
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:57,290
everything I had experienced

389
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:58,900
and carried it with me.

390
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:12,130
I also

391
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:13,980
made a backup

392
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:14,900
and hid it inside an Otherworld Tower,

393
00:24:15,590 --> 00:24:16,370
just in case.

394
00:24:17,630 --> 00:24:18,700
When I came back,

395
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:21,260
it would help me remember everything.

396
00:24:29,150 --> 00:24:30,330
To get out of here

397
00:24:30,870 --> 00:24:32,130
and avoid being captured by the Japanese again,

398
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:35,090
I used what I found in the cave

399
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:36,420
to set up a trap.

400
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:40,900
I found the way out,

401
00:24:41,870 --> 00:24:43,290
but there were Japanese soldiers

402
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,050
guarding the exit of the underground river,

403
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,940
and a giant Zhainiangniang

404
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:47,850
was lurking in the river behind me.

405
00:24:49,150 --> 00:24:49,940
It'd be risky

406
00:24:50,790 --> 00:24:51,740
to go out like this.

407
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:54,290
So I needed a foolproof plan.

408
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,530
I made a meatball

409
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,660
with fish and Lifeswapping Herb.

410
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:00,420
Then I dove underwater and escaped.

411
00:26:10,520 --> 00:26:11,370
Forgive me.

412
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,770
Forgive me.

413
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:14,050
Forgive me.

414
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:47,420
At the same time,

415
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:49,570
I hid all the key information

416
00:27:49,570 --> 00:27:50,500
inside my body.

417
00:29:46,390 --> 00:29:47,570
I discovered that Star-Moon Sand

418
00:29:48,110 --> 00:29:49,570
could neutralize the poison from Lifeswapping Herb.

419
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:51,220
So

420
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,570
I took a pill made from it

421
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,940
to slow my heartbeat

422
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,130
and enter a near-death state.

423
00:29:59,280 --> 00:29:59,850
Then,

424
00:30:00,870 --> 00:30:02,370
I carried the antidote made from Star-Moon Sand

425
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:04,530
and fell into a deep sleep.

426
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,740
I managed to escape,

427
00:30:10,960 --> 00:30:12,460
but I never expected

428
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,530
that being stuck in that box without air for so long

429
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:17,530
would make me lose my memory.

430
00:30:18,520 --> 00:30:19,090
So

431
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:21,330
it took us a long time

432
00:30:22,550 --> 00:30:23,610
to find our way back here.

433
00:30:37,980 --> 00:30:42,860
♪See the moon, indelible as ink...♪

434
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:44,330
I'm sorry, Master Zhang.

435
00:30:44,340 --> 00:30:46,380
♪As red plum blossoms fall along the street...♪

436
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,460
I killed Zhang Yuanhang.

437
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:51,770
Don't blame yourself.

438
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:54,330
I told you.

439
00:30:55,150 --> 00:30:55,850
I believe you.

440
00:30:57,110 --> 00:30:57,930
You are absolutely not

441
00:30:57,930 --> 00:30:59,020
the kind of person you think you are.

442
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,700
I doubted myself before

443
00:31:03,790 --> 00:31:04,530
because deep down,

444
00:31:04,550 --> 00:31:05,800
I was really afraid.

445
00:31:06,630 --> 00:31:07,220
I thought I was someone

446
00:31:07,220 --> 00:31:08,420
who could kill innocent people.

447
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:12,530
I was afraid Zhang Yuanhang would hurt me,

448
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:14,570
so I killed him.

449
00:31:16,740 --> 00:31:19,020
♪I drink a cup of rough wine♪

450
00:31:19,020 --> 00:31:24,180
♪Right and wrong pass with the changing seasons...♪

451
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,180
We all

452
00:31:27,190 --> 00:31:28,090
have fear deep down.

453
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,180
Courage

454
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:32,900
only comes

455
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:33,740
when we're faced with a choice.

456
00:31:37,310 --> 00:31:38,810
So before you have to choose,

457
00:31:39,870 --> 00:31:41,100
it's fine to be weak.

458
00:31:41,100 --> 00:31:47,500
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

459
00:31:47,860 --> 00:31:53,700
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine...♪

460
00:31:54,630 --> 00:31:56,050
About what happened to Wu Tie back then,

461
00:31:58,110 --> 00:31:58,850
I think I finally understand

462
00:31:58,870 --> 00:32:00,020
why you did what you did.

463
00:32:00,060 --> 00:32:06,180
♪When a thousand sails ride wind and waves home, I'll sail with you again♪

464
00:32:06,460 --> 00:32:12,620
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

465
00:32:13,140 --> 00:32:17,660
♪Before the night grows cold, old tales replay a thousand times...♪

466
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:19,700
Yes.

467
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,570
You were right this time.

468
00:32:22,150 --> 00:32:23,180
I didn't betray my country

469
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,090
or my people.

470
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:27,050
And I certainly didn't harm Unit 401.

471
00:32:27,260 --> 00:32:33,060
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

472
00:32:34,100 --> 00:32:36,060
♪And get drunk with you♪

473
00:32:38,550 --> 00:32:40,610
Thank goodness!

474
00:32:40,630 --> 00:32:42,020
The ancestors must be watching over us.

475
00:32:42,110 --> 00:32:43,510
You two

476
00:32:43,510 --> 00:32:44,570
finally made peace.

477
00:32:46,350 --> 00:32:48,660
Does that mean the oath I swore

478
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:50,420
doesn't count anymore?

479
00:32:52,280 --> 00:32:53,220
Thank goodness!

480
00:32:53,760 --> 00:32:54,770
You were just saying

481
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,500
the Mystic Nine would fall apart.

482
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:57,570
Looks like

483
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,090
that's not happening.

484
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:00,980
So you've remembered everything

485
00:33:01,590 --> 00:33:02,370
that happened before?

486
00:33:03,310 --> 00:33:03,900
That's right.

487
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:06,290
The last time I was here,

488
00:33:06,870 --> 00:33:08,020
I'd already mapped out

489
00:33:08,040 --> 00:33:08,900
the infinite Otherworld Tower.

490
00:33:09,590 --> 00:33:11,050
The place where I hid Unit 401

491
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:12,570
is very close

492
00:33:12,590 --> 00:33:13,530
to where Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

493
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:14,570
was trying to get to.

494
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:29,460
The Xumi Realm

495
00:33:30,350 --> 00:33:31,850
is one enormous underground cavern.

496
00:33:32,390 --> 00:33:33,020
Someone had been building

497
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,020
Otherworld Towers here one after another.

498
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:35,940
All using the same design.

499
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,020
They just built

500
00:33:37,020 --> 00:33:37,660
more and more,

501
00:33:38,070 --> 00:33:38,740
until eventually,

502
00:33:39,280 --> 00:33:40,570
the towers were all connected.

503
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:44,900
So

504
00:33:46,390 --> 00:33:47,180
you're saying

505
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:50,090
the entire underground cavern

506
00:33:50,760 --> 00:33:52,420
is filled with Otherworld Towers

507
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,220
from different eras?

508
00:33:57,830 --> 00:33:58,810
I've been wondering.

509
00:33:59,590 --> 00:34:00,660
Could it be that everyone

510
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,740
who gained something from the Xumi Realm

511
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:02,980
had to build

512
00:34:03,280 --> 00:34:04,290
an Otherworld Tower here

513
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:06,530
as an offering?

514
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:08,530
Eventually, the old and new towers

515
00:34:08,750 --> 00:34:09,650
became connected.

516
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,380
I've seen something similar before.

517
00:34:12,710 --> 00:34:13,690
A family tomb.

518
00:34:15,230 --> 00:34:16,420
Every time they held a ritual,

519
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,420
they built another tomb gate.

520
00:34:19,520 --> 00:34:20,340
That family continued

521
00:34:20,630 --> 00:34:21,860
for over two thousand years.

522
00:34:22,750 --> 00:34:24,170
The tomb gates were built one after another,

523
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:27,380
forming something like a dragon.

524
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:29,650
But why did they

525
00:34:30,190 --> 00:34:31,570
keep building these towers?

526
00:34:35,630 --> 00:34:36,500
There's a theory

527
00:34:38,070 --> 00:34:39,210
that if you want to attain

528
00:34:39,230 --> 00:34:40,210
a certain kind of blessing,

529
00:34:41,630 --> 00:34:42,340
you have

530
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:43,530
to build a tower

531
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:44,780
in a place with good feng shui.

532
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:48,610
Then you build an identical tower

533
00:34:49,190 --> 00:34:50,780
where you want to live.

534
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:54,610
You plant your hair

535
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:55,730
and fingernails

536
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,690
in the fengshui tower

537
00:34:58,110 --> 00:34:58,940
while you

538
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:00,420
continue living

539
00:35:00,440 --> 00:35:01,300
in the other one.

540
00:35:02,630 --> 00:35:04,250
It's a way of bringing

541
00:35:04,590 --> 00:35:05,860
the good fengshui into your own life.

542
00:35:09,550 --> 00:35:10,420
So you're saying

543
00:35:11,110 --> 00:35:12,530
the people who entered the Xumi Realm

544
00:35:12,960 --> 00:35:14,250
discovered some kind of special power

545
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:15,530
within these towers.

546
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:17,130
To bring that power outside,

547
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:18,380
they had to build

548
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:19,250
an Otherworld Tower here,

549
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,170
and

550
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:22,500
another identical one outside,

551
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:25,170
so the energy between the two towers

552
00:35:25,400 --> 00:35:26,380
could remain connected.

553
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:27,250
Exactly.

554
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,170
Why did it have to be an Otherworld Tower?

555
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:30,340
Couldn't it be an Eight Great Alley?
[*Brothel]

556
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:39,170
Master Zhang, I was just joking.

557
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,530
The shape of each tower

558
00:35:44,040 --> 00:35:45,340
must've been strictly prescribed, right?

559
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,170
Exactly.

560
00:35:47,110 --> 00:35:48,250
This is what the infinite Otherworld Tower looked like

561
00:35:48,590 --> 00:35:50,090
after I finished exploring it.

562
00:35:50,750 --> 00:35:51,900
The infinite Otherworld Tower

563
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,420
is shaped like a morning glory.

564
00:35:55,070 --> 00:35:56,050
This morning glory

565
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:57,570
must've been

566
00:35:57,710 --> 00:35:59,210
one of Yin Changshang's signature symbols.

567
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:00,570
That's why he incorporated it

568
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:01,530
into the entire structure

569
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:02,570
of the infinite Otherworld Tower.

570
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:04,610
Look.

571
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:06,690
This is where

572
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,780
I hid Unit 401.

573
00:36:10,590 --> 00:36:11,130
And this is where

574
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,300
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

575
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:14,210
was trying to get to.

576
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:18,170
The fruit of the morning glory.

577
00:36:18,630 --> 00:36:19,420
This must be where

578
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:20,650
all of Yin Changsheng's secrets are hidden.

579
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:22,530
That's why Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

580
00:36:23,150 --> 00:36:24,380
is so obsessed with it.

581
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:28,900
Hatoyama!

582
00:36:39,520 --> 00:36:40,130
Do you think

583
00:36:40,630 --> 00:36:42,940
Hatoyama already knows

584
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:44,860
where the fruit chamber is?

585
00:36:45,040 --> 00:36:45,780
Tiezui, Xiaoyu,

586
00:36:46,400 --> 00:36:47,340
go rescue Unit 401.

587
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:48,690
Laogou and I

588
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:49,610
will go to the fruit chamber.

589
00:36:50,270 --> 00:36:50,690
Got it.

590
00:37:03,040 --> 00:37:04,500
The structure of this tower

591
00:37:05,710 --> 00:37:07,300
is like a morning glory vine.

592
00:37:11,110 --> 00:37:12,780
Its inner workings are incredibly intricate.

593
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:15,820
This is the fruit of the morning glory.

594
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:17,530
It's the most important place

595
00:37:17,550 --> 00:37:18,500
in the entire tower,

596
00:37:19,630 --> 00:37:20,980
and the source of Star-Moon Sand.

597
00:37:22,750 --> 00:37:23,570
As long as Star-Moon Sand

598
00:37:23,590 --> 00:37:25,020
continues to be produced,

599
00:37:25,750 --> 00:37:26,820
the cycle here

600
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,500
will never end.

601
00:37:52,110 --> 00:37:53,090
He only gave us

602
00:37:53,110 --> 00:37:54,500
such a tiny piece of paper.

603
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,730
I can't even make out

604
00:37:55,750 --> 00:37:56,690
the map on it.

605
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:58,340
How are we supposed to find it?

606
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:01,940
Stinky Yu.

607
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:12,650
I think it's here.

608
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:14,900
You can find it from this?

609
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:18,530
Impressive.

610
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:20,020
Stay put.

611
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:22,820
What's wrong?

612
00:38:31,750 --> 00:38:32,730
My goodness.

613
00:38:33,230 --> 00:38:34,460
There's a mechanism here too.

614
00:38:35,520 --> 00:38:36,420
The mechanism is very unique.

615
00:38:37,270 --> 00:38:38,130
It was designed by Master Zhang.

616
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:40,610
Only Zhang family soldiers can disarm it.

617
00:38:41,040 --> 00:38:42,210
You mean

618
00:38:42,930 --> 00:38:45,090
Unit 401 set up this mechanism?

619
00:38:49,590 --> 00:38:50,690
Looks like this is exactly

620
00:38:52,040 --> 00:38:53,650
Yin Changsheng's alchemy chamber

621
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:55,780
Hatoyama has been dreaming of.

622
00:39:15,640 --> 00:39:17,020
So much dynamite.

623
00:39:18,470 --> 00:39:19,530
Fifth Master was right.

624
00:39:20,230 --> 00:39:21,380
Unit 401 is here.

625
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:27,460
If this mechanism isn't disarmed

626
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:28,730
by someone from the Zhang family,

627
00:39:29,710 --> 00:39:30,980
we'll all die together.

628
00:39:31,710 --> 00:39:32,730
Die together?

629
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,900
Good thing you came with me.

630
00:39:50,630 --> 00:39:51,090
Hey.

631
00:39:52,270 --> 00:39:52,730
Hey.

632
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:56,530
Hey.

633
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:02,090
Xiaoyu, he's still breathing.

634
00:40:04,230 --> 00:40:05,610
His skin has aged so much.

635
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:07,380
It must be a side effect

636
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,300
from Lifeswapping Herb.

637
00:40:10,270 --> 00:40:10,900
But

638
00:40:11,630 --> 00:40:12,460
how are we supposed to get them out?

639
00:40:15,230 --> 00:40:16,170
Since this was

640
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:18,460
Yin Changsheng's alchemy chamber,

641
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:19,380
we should be able to find

642
00:40:19,800 --> 00:40:20,940
an antidote here.

643
00:40:33,710 --> 00:40:34,210
Eighth Master.

644
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:37,650
Why do you think Fifth Master discovered this place

645
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,460
but didn't destroy it right away?

646
00:40:40,070 --> 00:40:40,780
Instead,

647
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:41,460
he hid Unit 401 away.

648
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:43,130
Are you stupid?

649
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:45,210
How could he move

650
00:40:45,550 --> 00:40:46,530
a furnace this huge?

651
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:47,530
And it can't be destroyed either.

652
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:49,090
He had no choice.

653
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:50,650
Fifth Master

654
00:40:51,110 --> 00:40:52,650
must have figured

655
00:40:52,670 --> 00:40:53,730
Hatoyama would never find this place,

656
00:40:54,080 --> 00:40:54,900
so

657
00:40:55,060 --> 00:40:56,900
he hid Unit 401 here.

658
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:01,610
"Chief Extraction Supervisor.

659
00:41:03,190 --> 00:41:04,900
To obtain the Star-Moon Sand,

660
00:41:06,150 --> 00:41:07,820
one must wait until midnight on the Jiazi night,

661
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:10,940
when the moon lies between the Dipper and Ox constellations,

662
00:41:12,270 --> 00:41:13,820
under a cloudless sky.

663
00:41:17,590 --> 00:41:18,900
Only then can one obtain

664
00:41:19,630 --> 00:41:21,940
the black, shining Star-Moon pill.

665
00:41:23,440 --> 00:41:24,380
This pill

666
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:26,650
can change one's fate.

667
00:41:27,550 --> 00:41:29,980
Unless one seeks the supreme path of cultivation,

668
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:31,820
it must not be taken lightly."

669
00:41:36,710 --> 00:41:37,380
Could it be

670
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:40,210
that this alchemy furnace...

671
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:07,090
It's Star-Moon Sand.

672
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:08,780
The ancient records say

673
00:42:09,270 --> 00:42:10,020
this furnace

674
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:12,420
was used by Yin Changsheng

675
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:13,530
to refine

676
00:42:13,590 --> 00:42:14,610
purer Star-Moon Sand.

677
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:15,780
Don't touch them.

678
00:42:17,150 --> 00:42:18,300
Be careful when you deal with them.

679
00:42:29,870 --> 00:42:30,500
Eighth Master,

680
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,570
are you sure this is the antidote?

681
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,210
What if something goes wrong?

682
00:42:37,110 --> 00:42:38,250
Do you have another option?

683
00:42:39,520 --> 00:42:40,420
Sit him up.

684
00:42:43,270 --> 00:42:44,020
Hurry.

685
00:43:04,150 --> 00:43:05,460
Give him some time to react.

686
00:43:18,630 --> 00:43:19,300
Eighth Master.

687
00:43:21,590 --> 00:43:22,980
Yes, it's me.

688
00:43:24,190 --> 00:43:25,050
This is great.

689
00:43:28,520 --> 00:43:29,420
Adjutant Xiaoyu.

690
00:43:31,230 --> 00:43:31,900
Stinky Yu.

691
00:43:32,590 --> 00:43:33,820
Looks like the pill really works.

692
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:34,860
Quick, give one to everyone.

693
00:43:35,150 --> 00:43:35,530
Go.

694
00:43:37,230 --> 00:43:38,250
You were here

695
00:43:38,270 --> 00:43:39,380
a few days ago.

696
00:43:40,400 --> 00:43:42,210
You just forgot

697
00:43:42,520 --> 00:43:43,170
because of Star-Moon Sand.

698
00:43:48,320 --> 00:43:49,690
This is what you discovered.

699
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:53,130
The Japanese are also trying

700
00:43:53,150 --> 00:43:54,730
to reach the place where the fruit is.

701
00:43:55,800 --> 00:43:57,610
They want to obtain this Star-Moon Sand.

702
00:43:58,190 --> 00:43:59,170
But that would be disastrous

703
00:43:59,440 --> 00:44:00,250
for us.

704
00:44:01,800 --> 00:44:02,940
So if we find the place

705
00:44:03,040 --> 00:44:04,380
where the fruit is,

706
00:44:04,550 --> 00:44:05,500
we destroy it and stop everything.

707
00:44:06,070 --> 00:44:06,900
Unfortunately,

708
00:44:07,800 --> 00:44:08,650
this place

709
00:44:09,960 --> 00:44:11,420
can't be completely destroyed.

710
00:44:12,800 --> 00:44:13,610
The place you need to go

711
00:44:15,230 --> 00:44:15,900
is here.

712
00:44:23,890 --> 00:44:25,380
This is the root of the morning glory.

713
00:44:27,000 --> 00:44:28,340
We can put an end to everything

714
00:44:29,070 --> 00:44:30,340
if we destroy this place.

715
00:44:36,360 --> 00:44:38,170
You won't be able to do this alone.

716
00:44:39,110 --> 00:44:40,420
You'd better regroup

717
00:44:40,440 --> 00:44:41,250
with your companions first.

718
00:44:42,710 --> 00:44:44,020
They're just ahead.

719
00:44:48,630 --> 00:44:49,380
Nian,

720
00:44:51,230 --> 00:44:52,820
as long as you believe in yourself,

721
00:44:55,520 --> 00:44:56,250
your wishes

722
00:44:57,520 --> 00:44:58,500
can come true.

723
00:45:02,630 --> 00:45:03,170
Oh, right.

724
00:45:06,480 --> 00:45:07,940
I used Wu Laogou to test you

725
00:45:10,000 --> 00:45:11,530
because I've finally realized

726
00:45:13,040 --> 00:45:14,020
that things between us

727
00:45:14,710 --> 00:45:15,780
were never meant to work out.

728
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:19,690
But the final choice

729
00:45:20,750 --> 00:45:21,860
is yours to make.

730
00:45:28,800 --> 00:45:29,570
Huo Jinnian,

731
00:45:30,440 --> 00:45:31,050
remember this.

732
00:45:31,920 --> 00:45:32,730
Only you

733
00:45:33,190 --> 00:45:34,570
can save yourself.

734
00:45:58,940 --> 00:46:03,100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

735
00:46:03,460 --> 00:46:06,180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

736
00:46:06,460 --> 00:46:09,260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

737
00:46:09,660 --> 00:46:13,420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

738
00:46:13,660 --> 00:46:17,100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

739
00:46:17,380 --> 00:46:20,780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

740
00:46:20,860 --> 00:46:28,140
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

741
00:46:28,580 --> 00:46:31,860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

742
00:46:32,140 --> 00:46:35,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

743
00:46:35,540 --> 00:46:39,580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

744
00:46:39,780 --> 00:46:43,140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

745
00:46:43,380 --> 00:46:46,740
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

746
00:46:46,980 --> 00:46:50,260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

747
00:46:50,580 --> 00:46:54,260
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

748
00:46:54,460 --> 00:46:57,700
♪Take care♪

749
00:46:57,700 --> 00:47:00,260
♪We once raced♪

750
00:47:00,340 --> 00:47:02,260
♪For the dawn♪

751
00:47:02,420 --> 00:47:05,700
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

752
00:47:05,820 --> 00:47:09,100
♪In the web of fate♪

753
00:47:09,100 --> 00:47:12,300
♪No one can escape♪

754
00:47:13,300 --> 00:47:15,140
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

755
00:47:15,300 --> 00:47:16,860
♪We too were young once♪

756
00:47:16,940 --> 00:47:20,380
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

757
00:47:20,580 --> 00:47:22,900
♪Keep the ember lit♪

758
00:47:23,020 --> 00:47:27,540
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

759
00:47:27,660 --> 00:47:30,620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

760
00:47:30,860 --> 00:47:34,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

761
00:47:34,500 --> 00:47:38,260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

762
00:47:38,580 --> 00:47:42,060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

763
00:47:42,220 --> 00:47:45,220
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

764
00:47:45,460 --> 00:47:49,220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

765
00:47:49,380 --> 00:47:53,100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

766
00:47:53,220 --> 00:48:04,660
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
